\begin{tabular}{lc}
\toprule
Component & Mean (ms) \\
\midrule
VLA forward $K{=}1$ (batched) & ${\sim}$170 \\
VLA forward $K{=}2$ (batched) & ${\sim}$170 \\
CRM forward & 0.25 \\
\midrule
ACR-VLA (low uncertainty, no CRM) & ${\sim}$170 \\
ACR-VLA (high uncertainty, + CRM) & ${\sim}$170 \\
